00:09:10.000 --> 00:09:45.000
It can't be that better teams with higher quality relationships more able and willing to collaborate effectively, to coordinate clearly could have more, not fewer, adverse drug events. And I suddenly had a thought, you know, maybe better teams don't make more mistakes. Maybe they're more able and willing to report them. And I suddenly remembered that I had inserted an extra question that wasn't in the original survey that is stated as follows.

