He only knew that there was a study of error going on. And I said, I just want your impression of what it's like to work in these units. I want you to observe them. I want you to observe them. I want you to interview them when they're on breaks and just learn as much as you can about these different work environments. Off he went. After a week or so, he came back. He said, they really are very different places to work.

